comments.body:
@ossie-git I've taken on board as much feedback as I could here. I've re-worded the introductory text. 
I've worked on making the terminology for all L1 controls much easier to understand and most of the L2 controls. I've removed most L1 controls unless they can be pen-tested or are about passwords. I've re-ordered to make passwords first, and then everything else in a suitable order that moves up the complexity pathway. I've made all biometric items L3 (unless they also cover plain MFA), I've fixed the 100 attempts issue. I've made restricted much less prominent, replacing it with what I meant. I've de-duped again, removing about 2 items. I've re-ordered each section to be L1/L2/L3 -> L2/L3 -> L3. I want to keep the grouping so that folks who only care about passwords only have ~ 12-15 items to comply with. 

@ossie-git @jmanico @danielcuthbert @tghosth @m8urnett please review as I think this is very close to final V2.
